# Honey fungus (harmless), native 24x16 frames: a tuft of three honey-brown caps on pale stems, each with a ring.
# Frames: idle1..idle3 (brightness pulse only, same silhouette), swell1/swell2 (D7 telegraph), spent (deflated after the burst).
